 · &lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt; foreign key · &lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt; unique rule&lt;br&gt;Blue header: needed by a Must feature&lt;br&gt;Grey dashed header: Should feature only&lt;br&gt;Grey text in the third column: who did it (…_by, author, actor).&lt;br&gt;These link to users; their lines are left out to keep the diagram readable.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Line ends (crow's foot)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Single bar: exactly one · circle + bar: zero or one&lt;br&gt;Circle + foot: zero or many · bar + foot: one or many" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BBBBBB;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1606" y="1400" width="372" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>